      "semantics": [
        "Matches nn.LSTM(64,128,2,batch_first=True) with input [512,20,64] and initial states h0,c0 [2,512,128].",
        "Executes standard PyTorch LSTM cell: gates = W_ih x_t + b_ih + W_hh h_{t-1} + b_hh; i=sigmoid(gates[0:hidden]), f=sigmoid(gates[hidden:2*hidden]), g=tanh(gates[2*hidden:3*hidden]), o=sigmoid(gates[3*hidden:4*hidden]); c_t=f*c_{t-1}+i*g; h_t=o*tanh(c_t).",
        "Returns (output, h_n, c_n) where output contains all sequence hidden states and h_n,c_n are final layer states, matching PyTorch LSTM tuple.",
